Package: fence-agents-scsi
Description-md5: f07553b1c4ea7e0174a63c47ee0e1324
Description-en: Fence Agents for Red Hat Cluster - SCSI-3 reservation agent
 Red Hat Fence Agents is a collection of scripts to handle remote power
